    {
      "name": "the row's boundary refuses [invalid-input] only a quest set core would take or throw on (objectives not a list, prerequisite or activation ids not strings, a giver that is not a string, a reward that is not a number, item rewards not { itemId, quantity, name? }); each may be absent or null; where core refuses the same set itself (no id, a duplicate id, a status it does not know), core's value is the answer",
